{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"GHSA-2qh5-382h-3jpc","published":"2026-09-08T20:56:26Z","modified":"2026-09-08T21:15:04.001246706Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-77634"],"summary":"CakePHP: SmtpTransport vulnerable to CRLF header injection","details":"### Impact\n\nCustom mail headers added with `Message::setHeaders()` or `addHeaders()` do not have CRLF replaced allowing header injection if user controlled data is added to message headers without stripping CRLF bytes.\n\n### Patches\n5.3.7, 5.2.14, 5.1.9, 4.6.5, 4.5.12 contain fixes for this issue.\n\n### Workarounds\nYou can strip CRLF bytes from email header values before setting header values.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"cakephp/cakephp","ecosystem":"Packagist","purl":"pkg:composer/cakephp/cakephp"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"4.5.0"},{"fixed":"4.5.12"}]}],"versions":["4.5.0","4.5.1","4.5.10","4.5.11","4.5.2","4.5.3","4.5.4","4.5.5","4.5.6","4.5.7","4.5.8","4.5.9"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/09/GHSA-2qh5-382h-3jpc/GHSA-2qh5-382h-3jpc.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cakephp/cakephp","ecosystem":"Packagist","purl":"pkg:composer/cakephp/cakephp"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"4.6.0"},{"fixed":"4.6.5"}]}],"versions":["4.6.0","4.6.1","4.6.2","4.6.3","4.6.4"],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/09/GHSA-2qh5-382h-3jpc/GHSA-2qh5-382h-3jpc.json"}},{"package":{"name":"cakephp/cakephp","ecosystem":"Packagist","purl":"pkg:composer/cakephp/cakephp"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"5.0.0"},{"fixed":"5.1.9"}]}],"versions":["5.0.0","5.0.1","5.0.10","5.0.11","5.0.2","5.0.3","5.0.4","5.0.5","5.0.6","5.0.7","5.0.8","5.0.9","5.1.0","5.1.0-RC1","5.1.0-RC2","5.1.1","5.1.2","5.1.4","5.1.5","5.1.6","5.1.7","5.1.8"],"database_specific":{"last_known_affected_version_range":"< 5.1.8","source":"https://gith